WEBVTT


00:00:06.992 --> 00:00:11.311
 All right, all right good evening ladies and gentlemen.

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:21.071
 I'd like to call to order the regular meeting of the University of City Council for Monday, August 3rd, 2026.

00:00:21.071 --> 00:00:24.992
 For those who are watching and those in the chamber, my name's Stan Fleming and on behalf of

00:00:24.992 --> 00:00:28.952
 the university place city council, we'd love to welcome all of you.

00:00:30.391 --> 00:00:33.911
 With that said, let's call, if the clerk would please call the roll.

00:00:33.911 --> 00:00:36.392
 Thank you Mayor, council member Figueroa.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:38.439
 Council Member Boykin.

00:00:38.439 --> 00:00:39.240
 I'm here.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:40.640
 Council member Cunningham.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:41.479
 Here.

00:00:41.479 --> 00:00:42.840
 Councilmember Wood.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:43.479
 Present.

00:00:43.479 --> 00:00:44.759
 Councilwoman Grassi.

00:00:44.759 --> 00:00:46.840
 Here, Mayor Pro Temaklowski.

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:48.280
 I am here, mayor Fleming.

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:48.799
 Here?

00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:49.920
 Mayor, you have a quorum.

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:50.640
 Thank you, ma'am.

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:53.359
 Let's move to item number three.

00:00:53.359 --> 00:00:56.039
 Pledge of Allegiance, I'd like to call on council member Wood

00:00:56.039 --> 00:00:57.479
 if he would lead us, please.

00:00:57.479 --> 00:01:01.640
 Please join me if you are able, and rise.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:04.959
 I pledge allegiance to the flag of the United States

00:01:04.959 --> 00:01:05.959
 of America.

00:01:05.903 --> 00:01:13.903
 And to the Republic for which it stands, one nation under God, indivisible, with liberty and justice for all.

00:01:17.903 --> 00:01:19.263
 Okay, thank you.

00:01:19.263 --> 00:01:22.664
 Would that like to move to item number four, approval of the agenda?

00:01:22.664 --> 00:01:25.144
 I'd like the call for a motion to approve the Agenda.

00:01:25.144 --> 00:01:32.063
 Make a Motion to amend the Agenda to remove item D from the consent agenda.

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:38.680
 Second.

